#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
B O T   H O S T  -  SINGLE-FILE EDITION
================================================================
Credit-based bot hosting platform, everything in ONE file.

All modules from the multi-file package are merged below:
config, tokencheck, db, payments, process_manager,
notify + the main bot logic (27 commands, banner on every reply,
co-owners, payment QR flow, 5 free welcome credits).

Your banner and UPI QR are EMBEDDED in this file and are written
to ./assets/ automatically on first run - nothing else to download.

The rentable GOJO x OMEGA template bot is EMBEDDED too: users can
/rent it instantly with their own bot token (2.5 credits/day).


H O W   T O   R U N
===================
1.  Install Python 3.11 or 3.12
    (https://www.python.org/downloads/ - avoid 3.13/3.14 for now).

2.  Install the libraries - paste this ONE line in cmd/PowerShell:

    python -m pip install "python-telegram-bot[job-queue]>=21.6" psutil "qrcode[pil]" httpx flask waitress

3.  Open this file in Notepad or VS Code and find the
    U S E R   S E T T I N G S block just below this help text.
    Paste your values between the quotes:

    USER_BOT_TOKEN       <- token from @BotFather
    USER_OWNER_ID        <- your numeric Telegram ID (send /id to @userinfobot)
    USER_ADMIN_LOG_CHAT  <- your private log channel id (like -1001234567890),
                            bot must be admin in that channel (optional)

    (A .env file or real environment variables also work and win
    over these settings.)

4.  Run:       python bothost.py
    First run creates ./data (database) and ./assets (images).

P R I C I N G
=============
1 credit = Rs.10  -  rent owner template 2.5 credits/day  -  host
your own file 5 credits/day  -  every new user gets 5 free credits.
"""

# =========================================================================
# U S E R   S E T T I N G S   <- paste your values between these quotes
# =========================================================================
